# Split frontend and backend

Frontend (`public/`, `packages/`) and backend (`pkg/`, `apps/`) ship on different cadences.

- Put frontend and backend work in separate changes unless one side cannot work without the other in the same release.
- If a paired change is required, say why in the pull request summary.
- Prefer thin API contracts and feature flags over a mixed mega-PR.
